    {
      "Nomor_ayat": 5187,
      "Ayat_Arabic": "فَاِذَا قُضِيَتِ الصَّلٰوةُ فَانْتَشِرُوْا فِى الْاَرْضِ وَابْتَغُوْا مِنْ فَضْلِ اللّٰهِ وَاذْكُرُوا اللّٰهَ كَثِيْرًا لَّعَلَّكُمْ تُفْلِحُوْنَ",
      "Text_Latin": "fa iza qudiyatis-salatu fantasyiru fil-ardi wabtagu min fadlillahi wazkurullaha kasiral la'allakum tuflihun",
      "Terjemah_in": "Apabila salat (Jumat) telah dilaksanakan, bertebaranlah kamu di bumi, carilah karunia Allah, dan ingatlah Allah sebanyak-banyaknya agar kamu beruntung.",
      "Terjemahan_En": "Then, when the prayer is concluded, disperse through the land, and seek God’s bounty, and remember God much, so that you may prosper.",
